      "name": "FillRectWithPattern",
      "signature": "void FillRectWithPattern(int * pRect, undefined1 byPattern)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Recursively fills rectangle with pattern using quadrant-based fill algorithm.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Validate rectangle bounds: left <= right, top <= bottom\n  2. If bounds invalid, trigger FogAssert and return\n  3. Calculate width = right - left and height = bottom - top\n  4. If both dimensions > 0, recursively fill four quadrants:\n     - Top-left: (left, midX, top, midY)\n     - Top-right: (midX, right, top, midY)\n     - Bottom-left: (left, midX, midY, bottom)\n     - Bottom-right: (midX, right, midY, bottom)\n\nParameters:\n  ECX pRect: Pointer to rectangle [left, top, right, bottom] (int array[4])\n  EDX byPattern: Pattern/flag byte for fill operation\n\nReturns:\n  void (fills in-place via pattern application)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Rectangle validation against bounds (left/right and top/bottom)\n  - Empty rectangles (zero width or height) are skipped\n  - FogAssert triggers on invalid bounds and aborts with 0xFFFFFFFF error\n  - Recursive calls process rectangle quadrants\n",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:ee56aef3e32fb58533c07d2a5044d69581d79c28f9ddc6a21c2231fbe383e4a1",
