      "name": "DrawLineToBuffer",
      "signature": "void DrawLineToBuffer(int * pStartPoint, int * pEndPoint, byte bColor)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Draws a line between two points in the frame buffer using fixed-point arithmetic.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate delta X (iVar1) and delta Y (iVar3) between start and end points\n2. Compute line length as integer square root of (dX^2 + dY^2) using iterative approximation\n3. Convert deltas to 16.16 fixed-point step increments (scaled by 0x10000 / lineLength)\n4. Skip pixels outside buffer bounds until reaching visible region\n5. For each step, accumulate fractional position and extract integer part when overflow occurs\n6. Write color byte to frame buffer at calculated pixel position (y * stride + x)\n7. Continue until all steps completed or position exits buffer bounds\n\nParameters:\npStartPoint - Pointer to starting point coordinates [x, y] as two consecutive ints\npEndPoint - Pointer to ending point coordinates [x, y] as two consecutive ints  \nbColor - Palette index or color byte to write for each pixel on the line\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns immediately if start and end points are identical (no line to draw)\n- Clips line segments that extend outside buffer boundaries\n- Uses signed arithmetic to handle lines in any direction\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x10000: Fixed-point scaling factor (16.16 format, 65536 = 1.0)\n- 0xffff: Threshold for extracting integer part from fixed-point accumulator\n- 0xffff0000: Negative threshold for fixed-point overflow detection\n\nSSA Variable Mapping:\n- iVar1: nDeltaX - X distance from start to end\n- iVar3: nDeltaY - Y distance from start to end  \n- iVar4: nAccumY - Fixed-point Y fractional accumulator\n- iVar5: nCurrentY - Current Y coordinate being drawn\n- iVar7: nAccumX - Fixed-point X fractional accumulator\n- pbVar6: pPixel - Pointer to current pixel in frame buffer",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:243a3084cc18afaf325069ba9d16616fc1e850be8c56c18b3678387b8a767c6a",
