      "name": "AppendMultipleStrings",
      "signature": "void AppendMultipleStrings(byte * pszDest, int nStrings)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Concatenates multiple strings to a destination buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. If cStrings <= 0, return immediately (no-op)\n  2. Loop cStrings times:\n     a. Read next string pointer from stack (param_2 + offset)\n     b. Call StrCat to append string to pszDest\n     c. Decrement counter\n\nParameters:\n  pszDest: Destination buffer to append strings to\n  cStrings: Number of string pointers to concatenate\n\nReturns:\n  None (void)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
