      "name": "RenderTileProjection",
      "signature": "undefined4 RenderTileProjection(TileProject * pTileProject, dword dwParam, int nViewType, byte * pSurfaceData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Renders tiles from a TileProject to the screen with clipping.\n  \n  Algorithm:\n  1. Allocate temporary buffer for tile projection data\n  2. Calculate screen bounds based on view type\n  3. Iterate through all tiles in project structure\n  4. Check each tile against clipping bounds\n  5. Extract color palette indices for valid tiles\n  6. Invoke DirectDraw renderer with tile data\n  \n  Parameters:\n    pTileProject (ecx): TileProject structure with tile data\n    dwParam (edx): Tile projection parameter\n    nViewType (stack): View type (0=normal, 1=half, 2=offset)\n    pSurfaceData (stack): Surface/bitmap data pointer\n  \n  Returns:\n    0: If allocation failed\n    1: If tiles were rendered\n    0: If no tiles in range",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:bcc628018e238e2ba9f49512bd5fe273d6f7cadcd40ad3239a6fbc0b33acd6b8",
