      "comment": "Plays a Bink video file with DirectDraw surface rendering.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if Bink is already initialized or disabled - exit early if so\n2. Initialize Bink sound system via BinkSetSoundSystem\n3. Determine expansion scope (4=base, 5=expansion) via GetExpansionFlag\n4. Open video file from MPQ archive via SFileOpenFileEx\n5. Select surface type based on nSurfaceType parameter:\n   - Type 1: 0x30800000 (RGB555)\n   - Type 2: 0x10800000 (RGB565)\n   - Type 3: 0x40800000 (RGB32)\n   - Default: 0x00800000\n6. Open Bink video via BinkOpen with selected surface type\n7. Calculate centering offsets for video within display area\n8. Set 500ms timeout for initial frame display\n9. Main playback loop:\n   a. Check completion flag, timeout, and disabled flag\n   b. Call optional callback if provided (ESP+0xa8)\n   c. Process Windows messages (WM_CLOSE, WM_LBUTTONDOWN, WM_CHAR, WM_RBUTTONDOWN, WM_MBUTTONDOWN)\n   d. Wait for Bink frame timing via BinkWait\n   e. Decode frame via BinkDoFrame\n   f. Lock DirectDraw surface, copy frame via BinkCopyToBuffer, unlock\n   g. Check if last frame reached, otherwise advance via BinkNextFrame\n10. Cleanup: Mute sound, close Bink handle, close file handle, restore sound\n\nParameters:\n  lpszVideoFile (ECX): Path to .bik video file in MPQ archive\n  nSurfaceType (EDX): DirectDraw surface format selector (1-3)\n\nReturns:\n  void * - Returns g_hBinkHandle on success, NULL on failure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns immediately if g_hBinkHandle already set (video playing)\n- Returns immediately if g_fBinkDisabled is set\n- User can abort via mouse click, keyboard, or WM_CLOSE\n- Aborted playback sets g_fBinkAbortRequested flag\n\nGlobals Used:\n  g_hBinkHandle (6f8f1120): Active Bink video handle\n  g_fBinkPlaybackComplete (6f8f112c): Set when video finishes\n  g_fBinkAbortRequested (6f8f1130): Set on user abort\n  g_dwBinkInputTime (6f8f1134): Tick count when user input detected\n  g_nBinkCenterX (6f8f1118): Horizontal centering offset\n  g_nBinkCenterY (6f8f111c): Vertical centering offset\n  g_dwBinkSurfaceType (6f8f1128): BinkDDSurfaceType result\n  g_pDirectDrawInterface (6f8f1bac): IDirectDraw interface pointer\n  g_fBinkDisabled (6f8f1bcc): Video playback disabled flag\n  g_pRenderCriticalSection (6f8f1bd0): Render thread synchronization\n  g_fRenderEnabled (6f8f153c): Rendering active flag\n  g_nDisplayWidth (6f8f1784): Screen width for centering\n  g_nDisplayHeight (6f8f1b8c): Screen height for centering\n\nMessage Handling:\n  WM_CLOSE (0x12): Sets both completion and abort flags\n  WM_CHAR (0x102): Sets local abort flag\n  WM_LBUTTONDOWN (0x201): Sets local abort flag\n  WM_RBUTTONDOWN (0x204): Sets local abort flag\n  WM_MBUTTONDOWN (0x207): Sets local abort flag",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.09d",
