      "name": "ClipRectangleToViewport",
      "signature": "int ClipRectangleToViewport(int offsetX, uint * pSourceRect, uint unknown, uint * pClipRect)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Validates and clips a rectangle against viewport/texture boundaries\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Validate first rectangle dimension against global max width constraint\\n2. Validate first rectangle dimension against global max height constraint\\n3. Calculate clamped width based on viewport max width limit\\n4. Calculate clamped height based on viewport max height limit\\n5. Validate offset parameter against dimension boundaries\\n6. Validate offset range against clamped dimensions\\n7. Calculate right edge from offset and width\\n8. Calculate bottom edge from offset and height\\n9. Validate all edges are within acceptable range\\n10. Set output clipped rectangle fields from computed boundaries\\n11. Calculate and validate output dimensions based on clipping results\\n\\nParameters:\\n  offsetX (ECX): Starting X offset or index into rectangle array\\n  pSourceRect (EDX): Pointer to source rectangle struct with fields:\\n    +0x00: width value (may be negative)\\n    +0x04: max width constraint from global (DAT_6f8d01c8)\\n    +0x08: height value (may be negative)\\n    +0x0c: max height constraint from global (DAT_6f8d01d8)\\n  unknown (Stack[0x4]): Unknown parameter used in bounds comparison\\n  pClipRect (Stack[0x8]): Output clipped rectangle pointer (receives 4 fields)\\n\\nReturns:\\n  EAX = 0: Clipping successful, pClipRect populated with clipped dimensions\\n  EAX = 1: Validation failed, dimensions invalid, pClipRect not modified\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n  - Handles negative dimensions using conditional sign-extension (SETLE/DEC/AND pattern)\\n  - Clamps values to global max constraints (DAT_6f8d01c8 for width, DAT_6f8d01d8 for height)\\n  - Returns error code 0xab to GetReturnAddress if output dimension is <= 0\\n  - All validation compares must pass or function returns failure code 1 immediately\\n  - Magic number 0xab: Error code passed to error handler on invalid result",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:aef99ba25380b88fd8e0cf3a24e39aea9fbf3b1e472a1012d8bbd95cacd661b0",
