      "name": "InitializeCodePageLocale",
      "signature": "int InitializeCodePageLocale(int nCodePage)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initializes character classification tables for a code page\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Acquire critical section lock (0x19) protecting code page initialization\n  2. Query code page identifier via FUN_6f8e92b2(nCodePage)\n  3. Check if code page tables already initialized in DAT_6f8f2368\n  4. If new code page:\n     a. Search known code page table at 0x6f8f08d0 (0x30-byte entries)\n     b. If found: load pre-computed character class tables from 0x6f8f08e0\n     c. If not found: call GetCPInfo() to retrieve OS code page information\n     d. Build character classification table (lead bytes = 0x04, trail bytes = 0x08)\n  5. Set global code page in DAT_6f8f2368 and flag _DAT_6f8f237c = 1\n  6. Release critical section lock (0x19)\n\nParameters:\n  nCodePage - Code page identifier (932=Shift-JIS, 936=GBK, 949=Korean, 950=Big5)\n\nReturns:\n  0 on success\n  -1 (0xffffffff) if DAT_6f8f21c8 == 0 (error condition)",
