      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Validates entity bounds and rendering parameters, then draws cel region if all checks pass.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize entity with validation of slots (at offset 0x3c)\n2. Retrieve entity data pointer from offset 0x3c\n3. Validate and extract three structure fields using helper functions\n4. Perform bounds checking: verify yCoordinate + yOffset is within horizontal bounds (0x6f8d01c8)\n5. Verify combined coordinate is non-negative\n6. Validate vertical coordinate and check against vertical bounds (0x6f8d01d8)\n7. If all validation passed, construct rendering parameters including palette data and mode\n8. Call DrawCelRegionClipped with entity pointer and rendering parameters\n9. Return 1 on success, 0 on validation failure\n\nParameters:\n- pEntity (ECX): Pointer to entity structure with data pointer at offset 0x3c\n- yOffset (EDX): Y-coordinate or dimension offset to add to entity's base coordinate\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Bounds validation passed and cel region was drawn successfully\n- 0: Entity initialization failed or bounds validation failed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If entity initialization returns 0, function returns immediately with 0\n- Palette data depends on mode byte: if 0xFF, uses default; if mode is 7, overrides palette\n- Extra parameter retrieved from offset 0xd0 in data structure with index from mode value",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:dcfe7513e1648d5334668629ca5751cb",
